IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `sdcpa-sewers-and-drains`

-- Sewerage, Drainage and Coastal Protection Act 1999, ss 9, 10, 13A, 16, 16A, 17, 20, 22, 22A, 24, 24A, 30, 31, 41, 42, 47, 63 and 67A -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_sewerage-drainage-and-coastal-protection-act-1999.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `Fixtures`

`a factory discharging rinse water with approval` MEANS Discharge WITH
    `into a public sewer or connected drain-line` IS TRUE
    `is trade effluent` IS TRUE
    `contains a dangerous or hazardous substance` IS FALSE
    `had the Board's prior written approval` IS TRUE
    `followed the approval conditions and regulations` IS TRUE
    `made in an emergency to avoid danger to life or property` IS FALSE
    `Board told in writing as soon as reasonably practicable` IS FALSE
    `caused injury, death, an inoperable sewer or severe disruption` IS FALSE

`a factory discharging rinse water without approval` MEANS Discharge WITH
    `into a public sewer or connected drain-line` IS TRUE
    `is trade effluent` IS TRUE
    `contains a dangerous or hazardous substance` IS FALSE
    `had the Board's prior written approval` IS FALSE
    `followed the approval conditions and regulations` IS FALSE
    `made in an emergency to avoid danger to life or property` IS FALSE
    `Board told in writing as soon as reasonably practicable` IS FALSE
    `caused injury, death, an inoperable sewer or severe disruption` IS FALSE

`a factory discharging rinse water in breach of its approval conditions` MEANS Discharge WITH
    `into a public sewer or connected drain-line` IS TRUE
    `is trade effluent` IS TRUE
    `contains a dangerous or hazardous substance` IS FALSE
    `had the Board's prior written approval` IS TRUE
    `followed the approval conditions and regulations` IS FALSE
    `made in an emergency to avoid danger to life or property` IS FALSE
    `Board told in writing as soon as reasonably practicable` IS FALSE
    `caused injury, death, an inoperable sewer or severe disruption` IS FALSE

`an emergency discharge reported to the Board at once` MEANS Discharge WITH
    `into a public sewer or connected drain-line` IS TRUE
    `is trade effluent` IS TRUE
    `contains a dangerous or hazardous substance` IS FALSE
    `had the Board's prior written approval` IS FALSE
    `followed the approval conditions and regulations` IS FALSE
    `made in an emergency to avoid danger to life or property` IS TRUE
    `Board told in writing as soon as reasonably practicable` IS TRUE
    `caused injury, death, an inoperable sewer or severe disruption` IS FALSE

`an emergency discharge never reported` MEANS Discharge WITH
    `into a public sewer or connected drain-line` IS TRUE
    `is trade effluent` IS TRUE
    `contains a dangerous or hazardous substance` IS FALSE
    `had the Board's prior written approval` IS FALSE
    `followed the approval conditions and regulations` IS FALSE
    `made in an emergency to avoid danger to life or property` IS TRUE
    `Board told in writing as soon as reasonably practicable` IS FALSE
    `caused injury, death, an inoperable sewer or severe disruption` IS FALSE

`an unapproved solvent discharge in an emergency, reported` MEANS Discharge WITH
    `into a public sewer or connected drain-line` IS TRUE
    `is trade effluent` IS TRUE
    `contains a dangerous or hazardous substance` IS TRUE
    `had the Board's prior written approval` IS FALSE
    `followed the approval conditions and regulations` IS FALSE
    `made in an emergency to avoid danger to life or property` IS TRUE
    `Board told in writing as soon as reasonably practicable` IS TRUE
    `caused injury, death, an inoperable sewer or severe disruption` IS FALSE

`an approved discharge of a hazardous substance` MEANS Discharge WITH
    `into a public sewer or connected drain-line` IS TRUE
    `is trade effluent` IS FALSE
    `contains a dangerous or hazardous substance` IS TRUE
    `had the Board's prior written approval` IS TRUE
    `followed the approval conditions and regulations` IS TRUE
    `made in an emergency to avoid danger to life or property` IS FALSE
    `Board told in writing as soon as reasonably practicable` IS FALSE
    `caused injury, death, an inoperable sewer or severe disruption` IS FALSE

`an unapproved solvent discharge that injures a sewer worker` MEANS Discharge WITH
    `into a public sewer or connected drain-line` IS TRUE
    `is trade effluent` IS TRUE
    `contains a dangerous or hazardous substance` IS TRUE
    `had the Board's prior written approval` IS FALSE
    `followed the approval conditions and regulations` IS FALSE
